  "ruleText": "Agr 1706.01 Turtle Size. In accordance with 21 CFR 1240.62, no person shall sell a turtle that has a carapace less than 4 inches from front to rear.\n\nSource. #10834, eff 5-21-15 (from Agr 1703.02); ss by #14164, eff 12-31-24 (formerly Agr 1705.01)",
